UPSTREAM NOTICE

This project is a fork of "one-node-flux-2-klein" by yanokusnir:
https://github.com/yanokusnir-ai/one-node-flux-2-klein

At the time of forking, the upstream project shipped no LICENSE file. Its README
stated: "This node itself is fully open source with no restrictions."

The MIT grant above is offered for the modifications and additions made in this
fork. Portions of the original work remain the copyright of their author, and the
upstream project's terms were never formally stated in a licence file. Anyone
redistributing this project, or building on it commercially, should be aware of
that and may wish to contact the original author.

Note also that the FLUX.2 [klein] models this node drives carry their own terms.
The 4B model is Apache 2.0; the 9B model is released under the FLUX Non-Commercial
License by Black Forest Labs and may not be used commercially. Model licensing is
independent of this software's licence and remains the user's responsibility.
